{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1226166-it-s-marine-boy-brave-and-free","id":1226166,"title":"It's Marine Boy, brave and free...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-06-09T19:55:10-07:00","id":1226166,"title":"It's Marine Boy, brave and free...","content":"fighting evil 'neath the sea. I'm wondering how many magical ways there are to enable underwater breathing. The obvious ones to me are Life 3 (Weaving) to become some variant of mermaid/merman, or Matter 2 Shielding to keep liquid away from the caster, allowing dissolved gasses to pass the barrier. What other ways can you think of?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-09T20:01:02-07:00","id":1226168,"title":"","content":"An old trick in Mage: The Ascension, if you had some Forces, you could break the water molecules into hydrogen and oxygen molecules using electricity. Typically, Forces 2 in Mage: the Ascension sufficed to work this magick.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13680-baakyocalder","name":"baakyocalder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13680_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-09T20:05:02-07:00","id":1226172,"title":"","content":"The problem with that is collecting the oxygen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-09T20:40:47-07:00","id":1226179,"title":"","content":"You don't really need oxygen, you just transmute with matter. Death to suppress needing to be alive I guess. Space to teleport air directly to you or something?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8122-archonares","name":"ArchonAres","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-09T23:04:54-07:00","id":1226208,"title":"","content":"Death can effectively suspend the need for biological functions.<br /> Forces can keep a bubble of air following you around, or electrolyze water (potentially problematic, that one).<br /> Life can give you gills.<br /> Matter can break apart water into Oxygen and Hydrogen, or just transmute water into air around you.<br /> Space could potentially keep bringing fresh air across a co-location into your general vicinity.<br /> Spirit could possibly convince an Ocean spirit to use some kind of weird 'water breathing' Numina to stop you from drowning.<br /> Time can stop things from 'worsening with time', which I guess includes suffocation?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12644-herbertisbestbert","name":"HerbertIsBestBert","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12644_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"312"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-10T09:11:53-07:00","id":1226248,"title":"","content":"It's expensive, awkward, and almost certainly a Paradox risk, but you could cast the Prime 3 spell Platonic Form with the +2 Reach option to create a set of Supernal SCUBA gear.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-10T10:54:23-07:00","id":1226262,"title":"","content":"You can also use Shifting the Odds to summon someone who can cast the spells for you. <br /> <br /> With Mind and Fate bonuses, you can probably invent a real submarine. <br /> <br /> With Matter you can probably improvise the makeshift submarine from the eclipse invasion in Avatar: The Last Airbender.<br /> <br /> With a perfecting of Prime, you could reinforce the truth of &quot;I am in dry land&quot; to create a breatheable reality bubble. But you will need some Forces levitation since you won't be able to swim.<br /> <br /> Take a tube of bamboo, connect the top breathing hole to the outside with Space for an infinite scuba gear.<br /> <br /> With Spirit and some diplomacy, you can get some help from the spirit of a school of fish. He can then use a Numina for Water Breathing on the cabal. Plus it could lead to some discrete spies and allies.<br /> <br /> Last but not least, if you need scale, any mage can use a hallow to enter the Astral and try to entreaty the goetia of Calypso, Poseidon, Ao Kuang or any other sea deity. Of course, that could escalate horribly fast. More deals for more power. Cabals and Pylons supporting different deities in their bid for supremacy, all the while the sea churning, thunder rolling and the world trembling under such unleashed might.<br /> <br /> All arcana are very flexible and can accomplish this, but with different risks. Also beware the small details, like decompression sickness, the multiple atmospheres of pressure, no light at abyssal depths and any non-Mage supernaturals that could be down there (like the Makara, or vampires with specialized Protean, perhaps even a God Machine ocean floor facility, etc).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 06-10-2018, 05:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"